# .gitattributes — JavaScript / TypeScript (GitHub-hosted)
#
# Sources: GitHub Docs (line endings), gitattributes/gitattributes Web.gitattributes,
# github-linguist overrides (generated / vendored / JSON-with-Comments).

# Default: detect text, normalize to LF in the repository
* text=auto

# --- Source ---
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.css text diff=css
*.cts text eol=lf
*.htm text diff=html
*.html text diff=html
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.mts text eol=lf
*.scss text diff=css
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf

# --- Lockfiles / maps (text but hide noisy diffs) ---
*.map text -diff
package-lock.json text eol=lf -diff
pnpm-lock.yaml text eol=lf -diff
yarn.lock text -diff

# --- Config ---
*.json text
*.toml text
*.yaml text
*.yml text
.*rc text
.*ignore text
package.json text eol=lf
tsconfig.json text linguist-language=JSON-with-Comments
jsconfig.json text linguist-language=JSON-with-Comments

# --- Scripts ---
*.bash text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.zsh text eol=lf
.husky/* text eol=lf

# --- Docs / meta ---
*.adoc text
*.markdown text diff=markdown
*.md text diff=markdown
*.txt text
AUTHORS text
CHANGELOG text
CHANGES text
CONTRIBUTING text
COPYING text
LICENSE text
NEWS text
README text
TODO text
.gitattributes text
.gitignore text

# --- Binary / fonts / media ---
*.eot binary
*.gif binary
*.gz binary
*.ico binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.tar binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary

# --- GitHub Linguist ---
**/*.min.css linguist-generated
**/*.min.js linguist-generated
**/dist/** linguist-generated
**/build/** linguist-generated
**/node_modules/** linguist-vendored
**/.yarn/releases/** binary
**/.yarn/plugins/** binary
